      "writtenOn": "2023-03-10T17:10:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Can you add comment explaining why manage_activity doesn\u0027t need to be called for CONFIG_GESTURE_SENSOR_DOUBLE_TAP?\n\nmanage_activity() needs to be called only for for DOUBLE_TAP, as it can be used in S5 (Pixel C light bar used as a battery level)\n\n\u003e Also, it\u0027s not CONFIG_GESTURE_HOST_DETECTION?\n\nCONFIG_GESTURE_HOST_DETECTION is enabled for all gesture, including on-body/off-body which is not enabled in S5.",
